e\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Soccer star Sakata is acting sloppily and Mataro suspects that one of the school's mysteries is to blame. It's time for a YSP club investigation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-24\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"In order to obtain some fortune-predicting chocolate, Jinpei and his pals join a very long line. But an upperclassman beats them to the punch.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-31\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Jinpei meets George Rukasu, a director at the school's film club. Later, George shows him some shocking footage of what he thinks is a real zombie.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-07\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Jinpei’s gang uncovers the school’s final mystery: Toiletta. Mataro gets a head start after he goes to the bathroom and is sucked down a toilet.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-14\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"The YSP Club's recent spike in popularity angers the student council president. Meanwhile, Jinpei and his pals investigate an indestructible building.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-21\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"After failing an exam, Jinpei and his friends must attend a prison-like re-education camp. They decide to break out, but escape may be impossible.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-28\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"News editor Nena Tokuda asks the YSP Club about an invisible, delinquent-like being she's covering. They follow the trail to someone unexpected: Mera.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-06\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"The school asks the YSP Club to test-run its recently repaired giant robot. But a jealous would-be pilot from another club wants the job for himself.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-13\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Fubuki takes her friends to the Future Science Club to see its new robotic exoskeleton. But they're shocked when it suddenly starts moving on its own.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-20\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"The school principal wants to get rid of a smutty book before his daughter finds it. But each time he throws it away, it mysteriously returns to him.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-27\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"A school event gives Jinpei and his pals a chance to test-play a VR game. It starts out fun, but soon a siren in the real world signals danger.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-03\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"The YSP Club enters the Quiz Research Club's contest, hoping to win the million-yen prize. But Jinpei and his pals are up against a tough opponent.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-10\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"Ms. Enra tasks the YSP Club with heading to the next Y Circle. Meanwhile, the school's disciplinary committee puts Kumako’s team under quarantine.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-17\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Episode 17\",\"overview\":\"After Koma starts acting funny, his friends discover he's got a crush on his pretty new study buddy Saori and help him to confess his feelings to her.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-24\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Episode 18\",\"overview\":\"After wreaking havoc at the Y-Mart, Jinpei and his pals must work on-site to repay the damage. They soon notice the place gets some weird customers.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-08\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Episode 19\",\"overview\":\"Jinpei encounters a member of the similarly named \\\"ESP Club,\\\" who challenges him to a supernatural battle. He must win or his club will lose its name.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-15\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Episode 20\",\"overview\":\"Ms. Enra shows the YSP Club some strange footage, leading Jinpei to suspect the normally helpful Mr. Usumizawa is behind the Onryo’s erratic behavior.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-22\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Episode 21\",\"overview\":\"The YSP Club gets an inquiry from a girl who sees the same strange dream every night. Jinpei takes her to a new club that researches reincarnation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-29\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Episode 22\",\"overview\":\"After vlogger Yokokin visits Y Academy, Jinpei gets jealous of his fame and decides to make some videos of his own. But his ideas are pretty boring.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-05\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Episode 23\",\"overview\":\"Ranto Kirigakure needs a powerful ally to combat the draconian Public Morals Committee and, together with the YSP Club, approaches the school's mafia.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Episode 24\",\"overview\":\"After changing into the fearsome Sky Snaker, Chiaki literally blows Jinpei away. Jinpei transforms into Blue Moon, but can't really fight back.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-19\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Episode 25\",\"overview\":\"Jinpei and his pals suspect that extraterrestrial forces are possessing Nayu and decide to investigate her, leading them to a team of female hackers.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-26\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Episode 26\",\"overview\":\"Lots of boys are stopping by Ranto's classroom to check out the beautiful new transfer student. But she seems oddly interested in Ranto himself.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-03\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Episode 27\",\"overview\":\"After the Public Morals Committee shuts down Y Lab, former member Haruki joins Mataro's superhero club, but a powerful watch soon sparks conflict.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-10\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Episode 28\",\"overview\":\"Summer vacation is here, so Jinpei and the other students still in the dorms decide to go camping. Nayu prepares to ensure they have a terrible time.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-17\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Episode 29\",\"overview\":\"Y Academy is abuzz with news about the escape of their well-known gorilla. Meanwhile, Jinpei and his friends hunt for a fabled mushroom in the forest.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-24\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Episode 30\",\"overview\":\"For summer vacation, Ryusuke heads home to his family's countryside manor. Despite being in familiar surroundings, he senses that something is off.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-31\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Episode 31\",\"overview\":\"After Koma doesn't come home one day, his mother shows up at Y Academy. She seems very kind and gentle, but there's another side to her personality.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-07\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":32,\"name\":\"Episode 32\",\"overview\":\"At the start of a new term, the YSP Club investigates a slew of recent alien sightings, noticing that the same thing has gone missing from each site.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-14\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":33,\"name\":\"Episode 33\",\"overview\":\"Ranto visits a fortified research facility to bring back the Y Lab and investigate Nayu. Jinpei and his friends witness a hair-raising transformation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-21\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":34,\"name\":\"Episode 34\",\"overview\":\"Kuka reveals her true identity to her friends at the new Y Lab. She then has them place beacons around the school to root out the alien on campus.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-28\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":35,\"name\":\"Episode 35\",\"overview\":\"Heading to the third Y Circle in search of a new addition to the team, Jinpei and his pals underestimate the desert heat and call Ranto for help.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":36,\"name\":\"Episode 36\",\"overview\":\"Jinpei, Koma and Mataro notice that they are feeling strangely forgetful of late. Meanwhile, the Onryo try to escape from Elzemekia's barrier.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-11\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":37,\"name\":\"Episode 37\",\"overview\":\"A terrifying feline monster chases Jinpei around the school. Just as the beast has him cornered, Kuka arrives on the scene with a useful invention.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-18\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":38,\"name\":\"Episode 38\",\"overview\":\"Earth Walker swiftly repels the enemy, but Elzemekia threatens to erase Ranto from existence. A familiar but unexpected face comes to the group’s aid.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":39,\"name\":\"Episode 39\",\"overview\":\"Nayu recounts what happened to her home planet. When the newly formed student council puts pressure on Eruna, she responds with a drastic declaration.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-02\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":40,\"name\":\"Episode 40\",\"overview\":\"After Eruna captures Ema, Ranto forms a special spy team to infiltrate the tower, destroy the mind-control machine and rescue their friend.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-09\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":41,\"name\":\"Episode 41\",\"overview\":\"Chiaki recognizes a team of invading alien canines. Ema tries to return a dropped medal to Jinpei as he is transforming, but something goes wrong.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-16\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":42,\"name\":\"Episode 42\",\"overview\":\"Mataro awakens to discover that the entire school has been whisked away to the middle of a vast desert. Ryusuke and Chiaki try to find their bearings.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-23\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":43,\"name\":\"Episode 43\",\"overview\":\"Eruna easily takes over the entire world. Jinpei and his friends try to transform but discover that their watches don't work within the castle walls.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-30\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":44,\"name\":\"Episode 44\",\"overview\":\"With time running out for Ranto, Nayu proposes destroying the transformation-preventing machine and reveals the surprising key to success: Mataro.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-06\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":45,\"name\":\"Episode 45\",\"overview\":\"As Ranto's punishment draws near, his friends and allies divide into platoons and begin their invasion of Eruna's highly fortified castle.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-13\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":46,\"name\":\"Episode 46\",\"overview\":\"Junpei and his pals prepare for the aliens' return. Meanwhile, Mr. Usumizawa finds a book that tells the tragic tale of a queen on an icy planet.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-20\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":47,\"name\":\"Episode 47\",\"overview\":\"Willing to do anything to protect her home world, Elzemekia attacks the school. Earth Walker and Deep Shadow Galaxy team up to put a stop to her.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-27\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":48,\"name\":\"Episode 48\",\"overview\":\"When the principal announces a school festival, the student council reforms to help make it a success — and also to prepare for the next alien attack.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":49,\"name\":\"Episode 49\",\"overview\":\"With just 10 minutes until the aliens attack, the YSP members must delay the impending assault and power up. Koma and Jinpei's mentor arrives to help.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-11\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":50,\"name\":\"Episode 50\",\"overview\":\"The YSP heroes fly off to take down enemies placed at volcanoes around the globe, but the speedy battle exhausts Jinpei so much that he falls asleep.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":51,\"name\":\"Episode 51\",\"overview\":\"Jinpei and Koma combine into their strongest form and pursue Mazera Bolt to the school building. But the fight seems futile even with Ranto's backup.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-08\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":52,\"name\":\"Episode 52\",\"overview\":\"In his new Black Cat form, Jinpei and his friends prove more than a match for Mazera Bolt. But their plan to destroy the black hole hits a snag.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-15\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":53,\"name\":\"Episode 53\",\"overview\":\"Flustered by an encounter with Jinpei's doppelgänger, Mataro tells the group what he saw. Shortly after, Jinpei meets the lookalike: Lime Ashiya.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-22\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":54,\"name\":\"Episode 54\",\"overview\":\"High school student president Gomanda calls for the middle school students to be expelled for their antics and soon finds ways to enforce his will.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-29\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":55,\"name\":\"Episode 55\",\"overview\":\"Jinpei and his pals head to the high school to confront Gomanda directly, but the fantastical setting makes them feel like they're on a field trip.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-05\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":56,\"name\":\"Episode 56\",\"overview\":\"With help from some knowledgeable allies, the group infiltrates Gomanda's headquarters. However, the path to their enemy proves deceptively tricky.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-12\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":57,\"name\":\"Episode 57\",\"overview\":\"Jinpei and his friends are anxious about the upcoming battle against the high school, but their mentor teaches them an impressive new technique.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-19\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":58,\"name\":\"Episode 58\",\"overview\":\"The battle between the junior and senior high schools finally begins, but Gomanda’s oddly combative view toward the younger students worries Susano.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-26\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":59,\"name\":\"Episode 59\",\"overview\":\"Gomanda reveals the cause of his hostility toward the junior high: an ominous visit from an intimidating school consultant named Chitei.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-05\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":60,\"name\":\"Episode 60\",\"overview\":\"A wormhole transports Jinpei and his friends to the legendary ancient civilization of Atlantis, where Rana finally reveals her secret identity.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-12\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":61,\"name\":\"Episode 61\",\"overview\":\"After Amana treats the students to an Atlantean feast, Lime talks of his past and resolves to take on Ozma. But Jinpei won’t let him do it alone.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-19\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":62,\"name\":\"Episode 62\",\"overview\":\"Now conscious of his true self, Lime vows to sacrifice Atlantis to save Earth. But Jinpei, believing that all life is connected, stands in his way.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-26\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":63,\"name\":\"Episode 63\",\"overview\":\"A glum Mataro reveals that his family will be moving to America for good. Jinpei and his friends get to work planning a grand farewell party.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-02\",\"runtime\":23}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-12-27\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}